   "urlId": "2013-941-fix-poste",
   "title": "Sage 100 ERP 2013 941 Printing Issues There Is a Fix",
   "sourceUrl": "",
   "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1673028159208\" id=\"item-62d9abbb9a630f3a59048f37\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-border-radii=\"&#123;&quot;topLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;topRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;&#125;\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-85b1cb67f07f8522a1bb\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The 941 printing issues that were reported last week have been postedSage have released a program patch for versions 4.30 and up for Sage 100 ERP which corrects a printing issue some users had affecting printing the 2013 IRS form 941.The original issue relates to the report itself which would resize the fonts incorrectly when the workstation display settings were NOT set to 100% (small) which is the default.The two report files which are updated:PR941A.RPTPRSCHB.RPTFor your version of Sage 100 ERP (fka Sage ERP MAS 90 and MAS 200) you can download the fix from:<a href=\"https://partners.sagenorthamerica.com/irj/go/km/docs/sageKM/Sage%20MAS%2090%20and%20200/Assets/PR5003.exe\" target=\"_blank\">PR5003-T</a> &nbsp;is for&nbsp;2013 PU 2 and <a href=\"https://partners.sagenorthamerica.com/irj/go/km/docs/sageKM/Sage%20MAS%2090%20and%20200/Assets/PR5003-T.doc\" target=\"_blank\">instructions</a>.<a href=\"https://partners.sagenorthamerica.com/irj/go/km/docs/sageKM/Sage%20MAS%2090%20and%20200/Assets/PR5002.exe\" target=\"_blank\">PR5002-T</a> is for&nbsp;2013 PU1 and <a href=\"https://partners.sagenorthamerica.com/irj/go/km/docs/sageKM/Sage%20MAS%2090%20and%20200/Assets/PR5002-T.doc\" target=\"_blank\">instructions</a>.<a href=\"https://partners.sagenorthamerica.com/irj/go/km/docs/sageKM/Sage%20MAS%2090%20and%20200/Assets/PR4066T.exe\" target=\"_blank\">PR4066-T</a> is for&nbsp;4.30.0.18 - 4.50.6.0 and <a href=\"https://partners.sagenorthamerica.com/irj/go/km/docs/sageKM/Sage%20MAS%2090%20and%20200/Assets/PR4066-T.doc\" target=\"_blank\">instructions</a>.You will need to login to the <a href=\"https://customers.sagenorthamerica.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Sage Customer Portal</a> before using those links.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div></div></div></div>",
